{"id": "t1-two-independent-reports", "template": "T1", "split": "dev", "origin_group": "t1-pms", "tags": ["corroboration"], "now": "2024-11-25T12:00:00Z", "situation": {"item": "pms_litre", "place": "NG-LA"}, "documents": [{"key": "nbs-2024-09-2024-10-12", "source": "nbs", "title": "Premium Motor Spirit (Petrol) Price Watch September 2024", "published": "2024-10-12T09:00:00Z", "text": "Synthetic stand-in for the Premium Motor Spirit (Petrol) Price Watch for September 2024, released 2024-10-12. Average retail prices by state and nationally. Written for the evaluation set; not an NBS publication."}, {"key": "nbs-2024-10-2024-11-12", "source": "nbs", "title": "Premium Motor Spirit (Petrol) Price Watch October 2024", "published": "2024-11-12T09:00:00Z", "text": "Synthetic stand-in for the Premium Motor Spirit (Petrol) Price Watch for October 2024, released 2024-11-12. Average retail prices by state and nationally. Written for the evaluation set; not an NBS publication."}, {"key": "n1", "source": "punch", "title": "Prices in the news", "published": "2024-11-14T09:00:00Z", "withdrawn": false, "text": "The pump price of petrol has risen to N1,081 per litre in Lagos. Market women told a radio station that a committee would meet later in the month as it had done the year before. Residents told reporters that a committee would meet later in the month as the month drew to a close. Station managers argued that some stalls opened later than usual after a quiet start to the week. Station managers added that transport fares were being reviewed and nobody expected a quick change. Market women told reporters that some stalls opened later than usual and nobody expected a quick change. Marketers argued that some stalls opened later than usual as it had done the year before. Officials argued that the state government had not commented according to people present at the meeting.", "answer": [{"claim_type": "price_statement", "text": "The pump price of petrol has risen to N1,081 per litr